 698+ 60A7 CB 3F            srl  a
 698+ 60A9 CB 3F          srl a
 698+ 60AB CB 3F          srl a
 699+ 60AD 4F               ld   c, a                  ; C = ColEnd (0..31)
 700+ 60AE
 701+ 60AE                  ; Calcola RowStart (H) e RowEnd (L)
