1171+ 7708 C5               push bc
1172+ 7709 78               ld   a, b
1173+ 770A C6 0F            add  a, 15
1174+ 770C 47               ld   b, a
1175+ 770D CD C7 76         call CheckWallCell
1176+ 7710 38 03            jr   c, .collision
1177+ 7712
1178+ 7712 C1               pop  bc
1179+ 7713 B7               or   a                 ; Reset carry (nessuna collisione)
