  95+ 7BE9 CB 3C            srl  h
  95+ 7BEB CB 1D          rr l
  96+ 7BED CB 3C            srl  h
  96+ 7BEF CB 1D          rr l
  97+ 7BF1 CB 3C            srl  h
  97+ 7BF3 CB 1D          rr l
  98+ 7BF5 CB 3C            srl  h
  98+ 7BF7 CB 1D          rr l
  99+ 7BF9 CB 3C            srl  h
  99+ 7BFB CB 1D          rr l
